        <briefdescription>
<para>Convert a flat physical index to a flat QTT index. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Interprets <computeroutput>physical_idx</computeroutput> as a C-contiguous (row-major) flat index into a tensor of shape <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_q_t_t_mapping_descriptor_1a76f602c37f198044351240756a1164fe" kindref="member">grid_sizes</ref></computeroutput>, extracts the per-dimension indices, and encodes each dimension&apos;s index into <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_q_t_t_mapping_descriptor_1ae374972f72c7120bcd58a1f37739df5f" kindref="member">bit_depths</ref>[d]</computeroutput> binary QTT modes (MSB first), yielding a flat C-contiguous index into the all-2 quantics-mode tensor.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>physical_idx</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Flat index into the unpadded tensor. Must satisfy <computeroutput>physical_idx &lt; product(grid_sizes)</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Flat QTT index into the quantics-mode tensor. </para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="exception"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>std::out_of_range</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>if <computeroutput>physical_idx &gt;= product(grid_sizes)</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>std::invalid_argument</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>if the descriptor is empty or inconsistent. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
<para>Convert flat physical index to C-contiguous multi-index in grid_sizes. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">ndims</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Return value.</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </inbodydescription>
