        <type>std::optional&lt; std::size_t &gt;</type>
        <definition>std::optional&lt; std::size_t &gt; themis::tensor::QTTMappingDescriptor::qttToPhysical</definition>
        <argsstring>(std::size_t qtt_idx) const</argsstring>
        <name>qttToPhysical</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::tensor::QTTMappingDescriptor::qttToPhysical</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>std::size_t</type>
          <declname>qtt_idx</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Convert a flat QTT index to a flat physical index. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Interprets <computeroutput>qtt_idx</computeroutput> as a C-contiguous (row-major) flat index into the all-2 quantics-mode tensor, reconstructs the per-dimension indices from the packed bit sequence (MSB first per dimension), and maps them back to a flat physical index in the original unpadded tensor.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>qtt_idx</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Flat index into the quantics-mode tensor. Must satisfy <computeroutput>qtt_idx &lt; product(padded_grid_sizes)</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The corresponding flat physical index in the unpadded tensor, or <computeroutput>std::nullopt</computeroutput> when <computeroutput>qtt_idx</computeroutput> addresses a zero-padded element (any reconstructed per-dimension index ≥ <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_q_t_t_mapping_descriptor_1a76f602c37f198044351240756a1164fe" kindref="member">grid_sizes</ref>[d]</computeroutput>). </para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="exception"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>std::out_of_range</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>if <computeroutput>qtt_idx &gt;= product(padded_grid_sizes)</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>std::invalid_argument</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>if the descriptor is empty or inconsistent. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
<para>Decode per-dimension indices from the packed QTT bit sequence (MSB first). <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">ndims</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Return value.</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </inbodydescription>
